@host = http://localhost:5080

### Liveness
GET {{host}}/health

### The supplier catalogue
GET {{host}}/api/suppliers

### Run a search (Server-Sent Events: search-started, quote-received / supplier-failed, search-completed)
POST {{host}}/api/searches
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream

{
  "origin": "Haifa",
  "destination": "Rotterdam",
  "fromDate": "2026-10-01",
  "toDate": "2026-10-08",
  "supplierIds": []
}

### Price history: filters, sorting and paging all run on the server
GET {{host}}/api/history?suppliers=albatross-freight&suppliers=driftwood-shipping&includeFailures=true&sortBy=price&sortDirection=asc&page=1&pageSize=20

### OpenAPI document (Development only)
GET {{host}}/openapi/v1.json
